        "description": "Integlight is a lightweight, fast, and beautifully designed WordPress theme that helps you turn your knowledge into a digital asset through blogging. It features clean typography, spacious layout, and eight professionally curated color schemes that make your content shine. No coding required—customize colors, layout, and typography easily through the WordPress Customizer. Ideal for writers and bloggers who want a clean and elegant blogging experience."
